                                                "sense_id": "8b23f4dd-b390-3b02-9fe1-7830988f2f13",
                                                "text": "Only two words in English possess a bare minimum resemblance to that of pictographics: eye (two es are the eyes, and the y is the nose) and bed (two vertical strokes from b and d compose the frame of the bed)."
